	Ai (Amnesiatic ESPer)
		*"I have to believe that someone out there cares about me. I have to be strong for their sake!"*
		*An amnesiac psychic evading the mysterious men in black who hunt her.*
		**Background**
			Ai awoke in an alley with no memory of who she was. As she wandered Tokyo trying to survive, she discovered she could sense others' thoughts and emotions, and even move objects with her mind. Worse, she found herself doggedly pursued by strange, unsettling men in black suits.
		**Personality**
			Shy and withdrawn, Ai struggles to connect with people and finds it hard to put her feelings into words. She'd rather avoid a problem than face it -- though her real trouble is that she has nowhere left to run.
		**Abilities**
			Art of Invisibility +2
			Attack (Telekinetic Power) +1
			Barrier +3 [Perks: No Gesture] (provides an alternate Defense Roll (the second Defense value below))
			Dexterous +2
			Knowledge (String Games) +1
			Psychic +3
			Quick +2
			Sixth Sense +3
			Telekinesis +3
		**Weaknesses**
			Amnesia −3
			Fear (Men in Black Suits) −2
			Frail −2
			Pacifist −1
			Shy −3
			Wanted (Men in Black) −3
			Weak −1
		**Combat**
			**Health:** 20 | **Endurance:** 40 | **Defense:** 4/5 | **Threat Value (TV):** 10
			**Attacks**
				**Telekinetic Push:** Roll **2 dice** | **DX 4** | **Endurance Cost: 5** (Perks: No Gesture, Ranged, Stunning; Flaws: Ineffective, Low Penetration). *Ai lashes out with her telekinetic powers, pushing the target away.*
				**Mind Break:** Roll **2 dice** | **DX 5** | **Endurance Cost: 5** (Perks: Armor Piercing, Fatiguing, No Gesture, Ranged, Will Attack; Flaws: Cancel: Unliving (−5)). *Ai fills another's mind with a confusing din of psychic energy, draining the opponent.*
		**Fluff**
			**Concept:** Amnesiatic ESPer, **Birthday:** May 13, **Age:** 17, **Gender:** Female, **Height:** 5'4", **Weight:** 111 lbs., **Hair:** Pink, **Eyes:** Lavender, **Association:** Unknown, **Hobbies:** String Games, **Favorite Food:** Taiyaki, **Allies:** None, **Enemies:** Men in Black.
	Auren (Time Skipping Sorcerer)
		*"It is my duty to protect this world, even if its future makes me doubt why I should bother…"*
		*A centuries-old sorcerer, accidentally de-aged and stranded in the wrong era while investigating a dark omen.*
		**Background**
			A young but gifted sorcerer of the secretive Order of the Fallen Star, Auren volunteered to use forbidden Time Magic to investigate a dire omen glimpsed by the Order's seer. The spell stranded him in 21st-century Japan and left him with the body of a teenager, unable to reverse the effect. With no way home, Auren has resolved to hunt down whatever threat he was sent to find.
		**Personality**
			Serious and stubborn, Auren struggles with the indignity of being treated as a mere teenager despite his true age, and often acts with an old-fashioned sense of authority he hasn't earned in this era. He's awkward around women and, for reasons of his own, deeply distrustful of animals.
		**Abilities**
			Armored (Medieval Armor) +1
			Attack (Sword & Sorcery) +3
			Combat Expert +3
			Evasive +2
			Knowledge (Magic) +4
			Magic, Arcane +3
			Smart +2
			Vigorous +2
		**Weaknesses**
			Ageism −1
			Arrogant −1
			Code of Conduct (Protecting Women… Begrudgingly) −1
			Easily Distracted −2
			Hatred (Animals) −1
			Ineptitude (Modern Technology) −3
			Quirk (Antiquated Language) −1
			Quirk (Stranger in a Strange Land) −2
			Stubborn −2
		**Combat**
			**Health:** 40 | **Endurance:** 60 | **Defense:** 4 | **Threat Value (TV):** 18
			**Attacks**
				**Orion:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 4** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Perks: Armor Piercing; Flaws: Weapon). *Auren's sword, crafted from unbreakable adamantite, is as beautiful as it is deadly.*
				**Fireball:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 6** | **Endurance Cost: 20** (Affinity: Fire; Perks: Continued Effect, Effective x2, Ranged). *Auren sends forth a spiralling blast of flame. Its magic continues to burn after it hits.*
				**Ice Spire Array:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 3** | **Endurance Cost: 20** (Affinity: Ice; Perks: Area Effect, Armor Piercing, Overwhelming, Ranged; Flaws: Feather Blow, Ineffective). *A prismatic array of frozen shards bombards multiple enemies, piercing any defenses.*
				**Thunder Godspell:** Roll **7 dice** | **DX 5** | **Endurance Cost: 20** (Affinity: Lightning; Perks: Accurate x2, Effective, Ranged, Stunning; Flaws: Delayed). *Auren summons a bolt of electrical energy that stuns its target. It rarely misses.*
		**Magic, Arcane**
			Spells: Mana Shield (Barrier +2; 10+ Endurance), Wings of Dezantis (Flight +2; 10 Endurance), Feeblemind (Intimidating +2; 10 Endurance), Breath (Life Support +2; 10 Endurance), Hasten (Quick +3; 20 Endurance), Atlas Arm (Strong +3; 20 Endurance).
		**Fluff**
			**Concept:** Time Skipping Sorcerer, **Birthday:** June 24, **Age:** 44 (Appears 16), **Gender:** Male, **Height:** 5'10", **Weight:** 152 lbs., **Hair:** Grey-Blue, **Eyes:** Grey, **Association:** Order of the Fallen Star, **Hobbies:** Fencing, **Favorite Food:** Mutton, **Allies:** None, **Enemies:** Mysterious Evil from the Future.
	Braun (Hopelessly Honest Inventor)
		*"I know that I'm not all that strong or brave... but I'll protect her with everything I've got!"*
		*A reclusive inventor who unexpectedly gained a robotic companion, and a reason to be braver.*
		**Background**
			A brilliant but socially awkward inventor, Braun lived alone surrounded by half-finished gadgets, always chasing the one breakthrough that would make his mark. That breakthrough turned out to be Miho, a damaged android he found discarded and repaired -- who has stayed loyally by his side ever since, upending his quiet, solitary life.
		**Personality**
			Introverted and easily flustered, especially around women, Braun is nonetheless kind and honest to a fault -- a terrible liar who wears his feelings openly. He can be absent-minded, and is an easy target for bullies.
		**Abilities**
			Connected +1
			Dimensional Pocket +2
			Inventor +3
			Knowledge (Computer Whiz) +4
			Knowledge (Cosplay) +2
			Knowledge (Games, Anime, & Manga) +2
			Pilot +1
			Smart +3
		**Weaknesses**
			Absent-Minded −1
			Clumsy −2
			Compulsion (Honesty) −2
			Nosebleeder −1
			Shy −1
			Weak −1
			Weak-Willed −1
		**Combat**
			**Health:** 40 | **Endurance:** 40 | **Defense:** 2 | **Threat Value (TV):** 0
			**Attacks**
				**First Day of Sale Shove!:** Roll **−2 dice** | **DX 1/2** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Affinity: Nerdy). *When a new Draconic Quest game is out, Braun can hold his place in line. Sometimes.*
		**Notes**
			**Inventions** -- Braun constantly scraps and rebuilds his inventions, but a few see regular use: a laptop with built-in hacking aids, and a pair of ordinary-looking glasses with several extrasensory functions, both kept handy via his Dimensional Pocket.
			**Connections & Cosplay** -- Braun occasionally trades in black-market parts he can't get otherwise, and sews and sells cosplay costumes for extra cash -- including most of Miho's own wardrobe.
		**Fluff**
			**Concept:** Hopelessly Honest Inventor, **Birthday:** November 29, **Age:** 20, **Gender:** Male, **Height:** 5'8", **Weight:** 133 lbs., **Hair:** Brown, **Eyes:** Blue, **Association:** Mecha Monthly Charter Subscriber, **Hobbies:** Video Games, **Favorite Food:** Pizza, **Allies:** Miho, **Enemies:** Malicron Corp.
