	Raine (Ambiguously Sexed Sword Master)
		*"I will atone for the sins of my past by helping those who cannot help themselves!"*
		*A wandering swordsman seeking atonement for his years as an assassin.*
		**Background**
			Once a skilled assassin for the Clan Cave Fox, Raine broke from the clan after discovering that a contract kill was, in fact, his own estranged father. Disgusted with himself, he abandoned that life -- but the clan doesn't let members leave, and dispatched his old comrade Shou to hunt him down. Raine now wanders, trying to atone by helping those he can.
		**Personality**
			Reserved and thoughtful, Raine speaks only when he has something worth saying, and his mind often wanders even when he's paying close attention -- a habit that leads people to underestimate him. He practices swordsmanship and origami in his spare time, often folding paper to help himself think.
		**Abilities**
			Agile +1
			Art of Invisibility +2
			Attack (Kaze Satsujinsha) +3
			Beautiful +4
			Combat Expert +4
			Evasive +2
			Intuitive +1
			Iron-Willed +1
			Knowledge (Origami) +2
			Knowledge (Wilderness) +2
			Quick +1
			Sixth Sense +2
			Vigorous +2
		**Weaknesses**
			Airhead −1
			Code of Conduct (Will Not Fight Surprised or Defenseless Opponents) −2
			Guardian (Those in Need) −2
			Ineptitude (Home Economics) −3
			Pacifist −1
			Poor −3
			Rival (Shou) −2
			Secret (Past as an Assassin) −2
			Sensitivity (Sexual Misidentification) −1
			Unique Weakness (Nightmares) −1
			Wanted (Clan Cave Fox) −3
		**Combat**
			**Health:** 40 | **Endurance:** 60 | **Defense:** 5 | **Threat Value (TV):** 18
			**Attacks**
				**Kaze Satsujinsha:** Roll **7 dice** | **DX 4** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Perks: Armor Piercing; Flaws: Weapon). *Raine's skill with a sword is extraordinary. His legendary katana is a suitable companion.*
				**Raging Thunder Slash:** Roll **7 dice** | **DX 7** | **Endurance Cost: 10** (Affinity: Electricity; Perks: Effective x3; Flaws: Weapon). *Raine whispers across his blade before striking with crackling electrical energy.*
				**Electrical Storm:** Roll **7 dice** | **DX 5** | **Endurance Cost: 10** (Affinity: Electricity; Perks: Area Effect x2, Effective; Flaws: Requirement: Must Be Outside (−10), Weapon). *Raine summons the power of nature to cut swaths through legions of enemies.*
				**Mist Touch:** Roll **7 dice** | **DX 4** | **Endurance Cost: 10** (Affinity: Spirit; Perks: Continued Effect, Fatiguing, Will Attack). *Raine concentrates his energies to project his very spirit into the opponent's mind.*
		**Notes**
			**Nightmares** -- Raine is plagued by nightmares of his violent past, especially his father's death, and rarely sleeps soundly -- his sudden awakenings can startle anyone nearby.
		**Fluff**
			**Concept:** Ambiguously Sexed Sword Master, **Birthday:** January 31, **Age:** 23, **Gender:** Male, **Height:** 5'9", **Weight:** 140 lbs., **Hair:** Brown, **Eyes:** Brown, **Association:** Previously of Clan Cave Fox, **Hobbies:** Origami, **Favorite Food:** Miso Soup, **Allies:** None, **Enemies:** Shou, Clan Cave Fox.
	Shou (Scarily Playful Ninja Hitman)
		*"Olly olly oxen free! Watch out now, here I come! This is going to be the best!"*
		*A playful, dangerously skilled assassin hunting down his former best friend.*
		**Background**
			Raised from childhood by the assassins of Clan Cave Fox, Shou never had to grow up -- his skill let him treat killing as a game. He spent years close to his fellow assassin Raine, until Raine broke from the Clan. Now Shou has been sent to track his old friend down, and he's treating the hunt as the best game yet.
		**Personality**
			Cheerful, playful, and utterly without remorse, Shou brings a childlike energy to a very adult occupation. He's easily won over by food, at least for a little while.
		**Abilities**
			Agile +2
			Art of Invisibility +3
			Attack (Ninjutsu) +2
			Combat Expert +1
			Evasive +2
			Knowledge (Food) +2
			Perceptive +2
			Quick +3
			Strong +1
			Teleport +3
			Tough +2
		**Weaknesses**
			Easily Distracted −1
			Impulsive −2
			Infamous (Assassin) −2
			Overconfident −2
			Quirk (Playfulness at All Times) −2
			Rival (Raine) −2
			Rude −2
			Servitude (Clan Cave Fox) −2
			Soft Spot (Food) −2
			Vulnerability (Light) −2
		**Combat**
			**Health:** 60 | **Endurance:** 40 | **Defense:** 7 | **Threat Value (TV):** 18
			**Attacks**
				**Bladed Tonfas:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 4** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Perks: Defensive; Flaws: Weapon). *The addition of a gleaming edge makes these otherwise humble weapons deadly.*
				**Sweep Kick:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 2** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Perks: Stunning; Flaws: Ineffective x2). *Shou unbalances his opponent with a swift, low kick.*
				**Pressure Strike:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 2** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Perks: Impairing; Flaws: Ineffective x2). *A precise blow that impedes the opponent's ability to fight.*
				**Dark Spark:** Roll **5 dice** | **DX 5** | **Endurance Cost: 0** (Affinity: Darkness; Perks: Effective x2, Ranged; Flaws: Backlash x2). *By focusing dark magics and striking his blades together, Shou sends out a bolt of energy that devours light in its path.*
		**Notes**
			**Dark World** -- A dead elder of Clan Cave Fox once trained Shou in shadow magic -- letting him become living shadow, cross distances in an instant, and strike with darkness-empowered blows. The bargain that granted these powers left his soul tainted, and he's vulnerable to light.
		**Fluff**
			**Concept:** Scarily Playful Ninja Hitman, **Birthday:** April 1, **Age:** 22, **Gender:** Male, **Height:** 6'1", **Weight:** 184 lbs., **Hair:** Bone, **Eyes:** Indigo, **Association:** Clan Cave Fox, **Hobbies:** Eating, **Favorite Food:** Tempura, **Allies:** The Clan, **Enemies:** Too Numerous to Count.
